WEBVTT

00:00.150 --> 00:01.430
Our group of galaxies.

00:02.162 --> 00:10.582
Six million light-years out, our galaxy and Andromeda are the two large members of a group of more than a hundred galaxies, most of them small.

00:11.295 --> 00:15.427
Where each one is has been measured; the shapes of the big spirals are models.
